  "play_store_details": {
    "package_name": "com.finance.loan.emicalculator",
    "title": "EMI Calculator: Calculate Loan",
    "short_description": "Smart EMI, SIP & Loan Calculator - Your Complete Financial Calculator Tool.",
    "full_description": "EMI Calculator app for all loans & loan calculator with Emi chart app. Easy EMI & cash calculator. Loan EMI calculator app & loan calculator. Finance calculator: loan interest calculator. Loan calculator financial tool. Car loan EMI calculator: EMI interest calculator & financial calculator. FD calculator & sip calculator help to calculate interest. Our EMI Calculator app includes a return calculator & retirement calculator as well. Easy calculations for Home, Car, Bike & Personal Loans eligibility calculator. <b>EMI Calculator & deposit calculator is a simple EMI loan calculation tool that helps the user to quickly calculate EMI for home loans and view payment schedules. Use this Emi loan app to calculate your EMI (Equated Monthly Installment) & interest calculator, effectively plan your loan repayment. The UI of this loan calculator is user-friendly.</b> Our EMI Calculator app & pension calculator simplifies loan management with its EMI and interest calculator features. As a comprehensive financial calculator tool our app is here to calculate your estimated loan amount with its loan calculator. Our loan assist features planning and budgeting is highly efficient. Whether you need to calculate EMIs or plan your finances, our app is here to help. With its user-friendly interface, it's the perfect EMI Calculator app for anyone seeking financial assistance. This EMI calculator app is the advanced Financial Tool that is useful for day-to-day life with all useful features and keeps up to date with the latest news. \n<b>MAIN FEATURES:</b>\n:heavy_check_mark: EMI Calculator app is a special kind of loan calculator that calculates your EMI Loan amount and monthly payment. :heavy_check_mark:This EMI Calculator app allows you to calculate the following values by inputting all the other values: - EMI Amount - Loan Amount - Interest Rate - Period (In Months and Years) :heavy_check_mark:The easy option is to compare between two loans. :heavy_check_mark:Representation of payment is split up in the table form. :heavy_check_mark: Graphical representation of complete tenure of Loan. :heavy_check_mark: Calculate EMI on a monthly basis. \n:heavy_check_mark: Generate statistics charts instantly on the EMI Calculator app. \n:heavy_check_mark:Statistics show Principal Amount, Interest rate, and remaining balance per month. \n:heavy_check_mark: Share computed PDF with anyone for EMI & loan planning. \n:heavy_check_mark:Easy GST Calculator option provides the option to find taxes to be paid by adding or removing GST amount. \n:heavy_check_mark:Get up to date with the latest Finance and Money related news. \n:heavy_check_mark: Find nearby Banks, ATMs, and Finance places around your location. \n:heavy_check_mark: Currency Converter feature provides 168+ currencies, live exchange rates & offline mode. \n:heavy_check_mark: Live currency rates provided \n:heavy_check_mark: Easy option to change the language of the EMI Calculator app from settings. \n<b>Additional Features of the EMI Calculator App:</b>\n <b>\u25cf Loan Calculator</b> <b>\u25cf GST Calculator</b> <b>\u25cf SIP Calculator</b> <b>\u25cf Currency Converter</b> <b>\u25cf Compare Loans</b> <b>\u25cf EMI Statistics</b> <b>\u25cf Finance Calculator & Statistics</b> <b>\u25cf Nearby Bank & ATM Finder</b> <b>\u25cf Financial News</b> \n\nNOTES: \n\u25cf This EMI Calculator app is just a financial tool and not any loan provider or connection with any NBFC or any finance services. \n\u25cf This app is working as a financial calculator app and not giving any lending services",
